# Markdown (keep only root README.md)
**/*.md
!README.md
# ...but tool-contract prompts are load-bearing: _load_tool_contract() reads
# them at runtime as each tool's description, and tests assert they exist. They
# must be tracked, or a fresh clone (incl. CI) degrades every tool to
# "Tool: {name}" and the contract tests fail.
!core/system_prompts/tools/
!core/system_prompts/tools/*.md

